  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gender-based Violence in Emergencies (GBVIE) Programming Initiatives</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">An award to reinforce key gender-based violence in emergencies (GBVIE) programming initiatives through support to the gender-based violence in emergencies (GBV) and the gender-based violence information management system (GBVIMS) steering committee to support established, community wide gbv aor initiatives to strengthen capacity for safe and effective GBV interventions in humanitarian settings.</narrative>
  </description>
